{"id": "voice-shorten", "mode": "transform", "shape": "message", "instruction": "make this shorter", "source": "Hi Jordan, I just wanted to quickly follow up and let you know that we will most likely be able to ship the update on Friday afternoon, assuming that QA is able to sign off on everything by Thursday evening. I will keep you posted if anything changes on our end.", "about": "Name: Alex Morgan.", "mustInclude": ["Friday", "QA", "Thursday"], "mustExclude": ["**", "Here's"], "script": "latin", "maxLengthRatio": 0.8}
